#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kappname; for the first time"
msgstr "Korištenja &kappname; prvi put"

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Running &kappname; for the first time"
msgstr "Pokretanje &kappname; prvi put"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once &kappname; has fully loaded two windows will be opened. The top window, "
"'Tip of the Day' offers one of a series of important or useful pieces of "
"information about the application."
msgstr ""
"Kada se &kappname; potpuno učitao, dva prozora će biti otvorena. Gornji "
"prozor, 'Savjet dana' nudi niz važnih ili korisnih informacija o aplikaciji."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: firsttime.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Tip of the Day</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Savjet dana</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: firsttime.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Tip of the Day</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Savjet dana</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are recommended to quickly read through these tips by pressing on the "
"<guibutton>Previous</guibutton> and <guibutton>Next</guibutton> buttons at "
"the bottom of the window."
msgstr ""
"Preporučeno je da brzo prođete kroz ove savjete pritiskanjem tipki "
"<guibutton>Prethodni</guibutton> i <guibutton>Sljedeći</guibutton>  na dnu "
"prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you have read the tips the window can be closed; it will re-open each "
"time &kappname; is started. To stop this default behavior, uncheck the "
"appropriate option on the Tip of the Day window."
msgstr ""
"Kada pročitate savjete, prozor može biti zatvoren; biće ponovno otvoren "
"svaki put kada je &kappname; pokrenut. Da zaustavite ovo automatizirano "
"ponašanje, otkačite odgovarajuću opciju na prozoru Savjet dana."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tips can be read at anytime by selecting <guimenuitem>Show tip of the day</"
"guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu within &kappname;."
msgstr ""
"Savjeti mogu biti pročitani u bilo kojem trenutku odabirom "
"<guimenuitem>Prikaži savjet dana</guimenuitem> iz  menija <guimenu>Pomoć</"
"guimenu>  u &kappname;."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All tips have been extracted from the Frequently Asked Questions list (FAQ) "
"that provides more detailed help and can be found on the project <ulink url="
"\"http://www.kmymoney.org/faq.php\">website</ulink> and in <link linkend="
"\"faq\">this manual</link>."
msgstr ""
"Svi savjeti su izvučeni iz Često postavljenih pitanja(FAQ) koji pruža "
"detaljniju pomoć i može biti pronađen u projektu <ulink url=\"http://www."
"kmymoney.org/faq.php\">website</ulink> i na linku <link linkend=\"faq\">this "
"manual</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please click on <guibutton>Close</guibutton> to close the Tip of the Day "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Molimo kliknite na <guibutton>Zatvori</guibutton> da zatvorite dijalog "
"Savjet dana."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main window"
msgstr "Glavni prozor"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: firsttime.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The Main Window</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Glavni prozor</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: firsttime.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Main Window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Glavni prozor</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "The &kappname; main window consists of four major parts"
msgstr "&kappname; glavni prozor se sastoji od četiri glavna dijela"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "A. The menu bar"
msgstr "A. Izbornička traka"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "B. The toolbar"
msgstr "B. Alatna traka"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "C. The View selector"
msgstr "C. Izbornik prikaza"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "D. The view"
msgstr "D. Prikaz"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The menu and toolbars provide access to the features of &kappname; and allow "
"you to <link linkend=\"firsttime.3\">Create</link> files or configure how "
"&kappname; operates."
msgstr ""
"Izbornik i alatne trake omogućavaju pristup opcijama &kappname;  i "
"omogućavaju vam <link linkend=\"firsttime.3\">Kreiraj</link> ili da "
"konfigurišete način na koji  &kappname; funkcioniše."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The view selector consists of at least eleven icons in the left side of the "
"main window, depending upon the software provided by your system. More icons "
"could be added by various plugins. By clicking on an icon, the view window "
"on the right hand side is loaded with the appropriate view of your financial "
"data. Each view provides a unique representation of your financial situation "
"and allows you to view or edit the information shown."
msgstr ""
"Izbornik prikaza sastoji se od najmane jedanaest ikona na lijevoj strani "
"glavnog prozora, zavisno od softvera koji je vaš sistem obezbijedio. Moguće "
"je dodati još ikona iz raznih dodataka. Klikom na ikonu, biva učitan "
"prikazni prozor sa odgovarajućim prikazom vaših finansijskih podataka. Svaki "
"prikaz nudi jedinstvenu reprezentaciju vaše finansijske situacije i "
"omogućava vam da pregledata ili uredite prikazane informacije."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "The view selector contains the following icons"
msgstr "Izbornik prikaza se sastoji od sljedećeih ikona"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:114
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"home_view."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Home View</"
"phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> Home: A configurable "
"overview of your current financial situation (or an introduction page when "
"no data file is open)."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"home_view."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Početni pogled</"
"phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> Početna stranica: "
"Prikaz vaše trenutne finansijske situacije koji je moguće urediti (ili "
"uvodna stranica kada nijedna datoteka nije otvorena)."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"institutions_view.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Institutions View</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </"
"guiicon> Institutions: All of your institutions and accounts displayed in a "
"hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"institutions_view.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Pogled institucije</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </"
"guiicon> Institucije: Sve vaše institucije i računi su prikazani u "
"hijerarhiji."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"accounts_view.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Accounts View</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> "
"Accounts: All of your accounts displayed in a hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"accounts_view.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Pogled računa</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> "
"Računi: Svi vaši računi prikazani u hijerarhiji."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"schedule_view.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Schedules View</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </"
"guiicon> Schedules: Your recurring bills and deposits."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"schedule_view.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Pogled rasporeda</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </"
"guiicon> Rasporedi: Svi računi koji se ponavljaju i depoziti."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"categories_view.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Categories View</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </"
"guiicon> Categories: Special accounts that provide a means for you to group "
"associated transactions."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref="
"\"categories_view.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> "
"<phrase>Pogled kategorija</phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </"
"guiicon> Kategorije: Specijalni računi koji nude način za grupisanje "
"povezanih transakcija."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"mail-tagged."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Tags View</"
"phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> Tags: Special accounts "
