"phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> Outbox: Used by the "
"online banking module to provide feedback on running processes. This is a "
"view provided by the KBanking plugin and may not be present on your system."
msgstr ""
"<guiicon> <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"outbox_view."
"png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Izlazni pogled</"
"phrase> </textobject> </inlinemediaobject> </guiicon> Izlazni spremnik: "
"Korišten od strane onlajn bankarskog modula za pružanje povratnih "
"informacija o pokrenutim procesima. Ovo je prikaz koji pruže KBanking "
"dodatak i koji možda ne postoji na vašem sistemu."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a new file"
msgstr "Kreiranje nove datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:333
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; keeps all the data about your finances in a file. As was stated "
"in <link linkend=\"makingmostof.basicaccounting.personalaccounts\">Defining "
"the accounts (personal records)</link>, you can keep more than one set of "
"accounts, but the data for each will be kept in a separate file, and "
"&kappname; can only have one file open at a time. See the chapter on <link "
"linkend=\"details.formats\">File Formats</link> for more details about "
"&kappname;'s data files."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; čuva sve podatke o vašim finansijama u datoteci. Kao što je "
"naglašeno u <link linkend=\"makingmostof.basicaccounting.personalaccounts"
"\">Definiranje računa (lični zapisi)</link>, možete čuvati više od jednog "
"skupa računa, ali će podaci biti čuvani u odvojenim datotekama, a &kappname; "
"može imati samo jednu otvorenu datoteku u određenom trenutku. Pogledajte "
"poglavlje na  <link linkend=\"details.formats\">Formati datoteka</link> za "
"više detalja od &kappname;-ovim datotekama."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new file you can either select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menu or choose "
"the <inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"new.png\"/></"
"imageobject><textobject><phrase>New</phrase></textobject></"
"inlinemediaobject> icon from the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Da biste kreirali novu datoteku odaberite <menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz izbornika ili "
"odaberite ikonu <inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"new.png"
"\"/></imageobject><textobject><phrase>Novi</phrase></textobject></"
"inlinemediaobject> iz alatne trake."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; will then open the <quote>New File Setup Wizard</quote> which "
"will guide you through the process of creating the file."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; će otvoriti <quote>Čarobnjak za podešavanje nove datoteke</quote> "
"koji će vas provesti kroz proces kreiranja datoteke."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: firsttime.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Personal Data Page</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Stranica ličnih podataka</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: firsttime.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Personal Data Page</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Stranica ličnih podataka</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since all fields are optional, you can use &kappname; without entering any "
"information now. Any information entered here is used only to personalize "
"your file. In the future, it may be used in some reports and for online "
"banking. If &kappname; requires any personal information in future releases "
"and finds none, you will be prompted to enter the relevant data then."
msgstr ""
"Kako su sva polja opcionalna, možete koristiti &kappname;  bez unošenja bilo "
"kakvih informacija. Sve informacije koje su unesene ovdje koriste se za "
"personaliziranje vašeg života. U budućnosti, mogu biti korištene za onlajn "
"bankarstvo. Ako &kappname;  zahtijeva bilo kakve lične informacije u budućim "
"izdanjima i ne uspije ih pronaći, biće zatražen unos relevantnih podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please enter your name and address or nothing and press <guibutton>Next</"
"guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Molimo unesite vaše ime i adresu ili ništa i pritisnite <guibutton>Dalje</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:383
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In case you have an address for yourself stored in the &kaddressbook;, the "
"button <guibutton>Load from Addressbook</guibutton> is enabled and pressing "
"it imports all information into &kappname;."
msgstr ""
"U slučaju da imate adresu spremljenu u &kaddressbook;, dugme "
"<guibutton>Učitaj iz adresara</guibutton> je pritisnuto i uvozi sve "
"informacije u &kappname;."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; supports multiple currencies. To set your base currency (the "
"currency you use day to day and which will be used for your reports), select "
"the appropriate entry from the list provided and press <guibutton>Next</"
"guibutton>. A default will be selected from &kappname; based upon your "
"locale settings."
msgstr ""
"&kappname;. podržava razne valute. Da postavite vašu baznu valutu(valuta "
"koju koristite svaki dan i koja će biti korištena za vaše izvještaje), "
"odaberite odgovarajući unos iz liste i pritisnite <guibutton>Dalje</"
"guibutton>. Unaprijed definisana valuta će biti odabrana od strane "
"&kappname;-a u zavisnosti od postavki vaše lokacije."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: firsttime.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid "Base currency selection Page"
msgstr "Stranica izbora bazne valute"

#. Tag: phrase
#: firsttime.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid "Base currency selection page"
msgstr "Stranica izbora bazne valute"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The following page allows you to create an initial account. For the typical "
"&kappname; user this is a checking account."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeća stranica vam omogućava da kreirate početni račun. Za tipičnog "
"&kappname; korisnika ovo je čekovni račun."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: firsttime.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid "Checking account creation Page"
msgstr "Stranica kreiranja čekovnog računa"

#. Tag: phrase
#: firsttime.docbook:424
#, no-c-format
msgid "Checking account creation page"
msgstr "Stranica kreiranja čekovnog računa"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the name of the account and a possible reference number assigned by "
"the institution managing the account. Enter the opening date of the account "
"and the opening balance of the account. For example, you want to use "
"&kappname; to manage all your finances as of 2008-01-01, then enter the "
"balance of the account at the beginning of this date. The number can "
"possibly be obtained from a paper statement. Also enter the name and routing "
"number of the institution, though this information is optional and only "
"required for online banking purposes."
msgstr ""
"Unesite ime računa i broj koji će biti dodijeljen od strane institucije koja "
"će upravljati računom. Unesite datum otvaranje računa i startni balans "
"računa. Naprimjer, želite koristiti &kappname;  za upravljanje finansijama "
"od 01-01-2007, unesite balans računa na početku ovog dana. Broj može biti "
"unesen sa papirnog izvještaja. Također unesite ime i broj usmjerenja "
"institucije, iako je ova informacija opcionalna i koristi se samo u svrhu "
"onlajn bankarstva."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In case you don't want to setup an initial account, please uncheck the check "
"box"
msgstr ""
"U slučaju da ne želite uspostaviti početni račun, molim otkačite kontrolni "
"okvir"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid "Once finished, press <guibutton>Next</guibutton> to proceed."
msgstr "Kada završite, pritisnite <guibutton>Dalje</guibutton> za nastavak."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: firsttime.docbook:451
#, no-c-format
msgid "Account template selection Page"
msgstr "Stranica odabira šablona računa"

#. Tag: phrase
#: firsttime.docbook:457
#, no-c-format
msgid "Account template selection page"
msgstr "Stranica odabira šablona računa"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:464
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose the appropriate country and account template(s). Multiple templates, "
"even from multiple countries can be selected using a combination of &Ctrl; "
"and &Shift; together with the left mouse button. The account hierarchy to be "
"setup will be shown in a preview part of the wizard. In case you cannot find "
"a template that suits your needs, don't select a template."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite odgovarajuću državu i šablon računa. Višestruki šabloni, čak i iz "
"više zemalja mogu biti odabrani korištenjem kombinacije &Ctrl; i &Shift; "
"zajedno sa lijevom tipkom miša. Hijerhija računa koja će biti uspostavljena "
"je prikazana u dijelu za predpregled čarobnjaka. U slučaju da ne možete naći "
"šablon koji odgovara vašim potrebama, nemojte odabrati šablon."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:473
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once finished with the template selection press <guibutton>Next</guibutton> "
"to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Kada završite sa odabirom šablona pritisnite <guibutton>Dalje</guibutton> za "
"nastavak."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:478
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next page of the wizard allows you to setup user preferences. Press "
"<guibutton>Next</guibutton> if you are done and want to proceed."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeća stranica čarobnjaka vam omogućava da podesite korisničke "
"prioritete. Pritisnite <guibutton>Dalje</guibutton> ako ste završili i "
"želite nastaviti."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: firsttime.docbook:485
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preference Page"
msgstr "Stranica prioriteta"

#. Tag: phrase
#: firsttime.docbook:491
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preference page"
msgstr "Stranica prioriteta"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:497
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The last page of the wizard allows you to select the filename that will be "
"used to store your financial data. An initial filename will be constructed "
"out of your HOME folder and user name. In case the file exists, a warning "
"will be displayed which reminds you to select a name of a non-existing file."
msgstr ""
"Posljednja stranica čarobnjaka vam omogućava da odabire ime datoteke koja će "
"biti korištena za pohranjivanje vaših finansijskih podataka. Početno ime "
"datoteke će biti konstruisano iz vašeg HOME direktorija i korisničkog imena. "
"U slučaju da datoteka postoji, biće prikazano upozorenje koje vas podsjeća "
"da odaberete ime nepostojeće datoteke."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: firsttime.docbook:506
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filename selection Page"
msgstr "Stranica odabira imena datoteke"

#. Tag: phrase
#: firsttime.docbook:512
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filename selection page"
msgstr "Stranica odabira imena datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:518
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you have entered all relevant information to create the file. Press "
"<guibutton>Finish</guibutton> and &kappname; will create the file for you "
"and open it."
msgstr ""
"Sada ste unijeli sve relevantne informacije za kreiranje datoteke. "
"Pritisnite <guibutton>Završi</guibutton> i &kappname; će kreirati datoteku i "
"otvoriti je."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:532
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating accounts"
msgstr "Kreiranje računa"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:534
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can create an account in one of two ways, both of which are described "
"here:"
msgstr ""
"Možete kreirati račun na jedan od dva načina, od kojih su oba opisana ovdje:"

#. Tag: term
#: firsttime.docbook:540
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the menu"
msgstr "Korištenje menija"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:542
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create an account using the menu select <menuchoice><guimenu>Accounts</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>New account</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Za kreiranje računa korištenjem menija odaberite  "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Računi</guimenu><guimenuitem>Novi račun</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."

#. Tag: term
#: firsttime.docbook:551
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the Accounts view"
msgstr "Korištenje pregleda računa"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:553
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create an account using the accounts view click on the Accounts icon "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"accounts_view."
"png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> in the view selector and "
"then right click on the Asset tree icon in the right hand view and select "
"<guimenuitem>New account</guimenuitem> from the popup menu. The Asset tree "
"holds all of your accounts that are an asset. Assets, and all the other "
"account types, are discussed in more detail later in this manual."
msgstr ""
"Da biste kreirali rečun korištenjem pregleda računa, kliknite na ikonu "
"Računi <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"accounts_view.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> u "
"odabiru pregleda i onda odaberite desnim klikom ikonu Stablo imovine u "
"desnom dijelu i odaberite <guimenuitem>Novi račun</guimenuitem> iz iskačućeg "
"izbornika. Stablo imovine čuva sve vaše račune koji su vezani za imovinu. "
"Imovinski, i svi ostali tipovi računa, su opisani detaljnije u ovom "
"priručniku."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:568
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that &kappname; uses the context menus a lot throughout the whole "
"application. If you find yourself stuck trying to figure out how to do "
"something, try right-clicking where you would expect to see a feature."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da &kappname; koristi kontekstualne izbornike kroz cijelu "
"aplikaciju. Ako se zaglavite prilikom obavljanja nekog zadatka, probajte "
"desni klik na mjestu gdje biste očekivali da se nalazi neka od opcija."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:575
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Creating a new account by either method opens the <emphasis>New Account "
"Wizard</emphasis>. This wizard will take you step by step through the "
"process of creating an account, gathering the required information at each "
"step. To navigate through the pages click on the <guibutton>Back</guibutton> "
"and <guibutton>Next</guibutton> buttons."
msgstr ""
"Kreiranje računa na bilo koji način otvara <emphasis>Čarobnjak za račun</"
"emphasis>. Ovaj čarobnjak će vas provesti kroz proces kreiranja računa korak "
"po korak, u međuvremenu prikupljajući sve potrebne informacije. Za "
"navigiranje kroz stranice kliknite na tipke <guibutton>Nazad</guibutton> i "
"<guibutton>Dalje</guibutton> ."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:583
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create an account using either of the two previously mentioned methods to "
"continue. A full description of creating accounts can be found in the <link "
"linkend=\"details.accounts\">Accounts</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Kreirajte račun korištenjem bilo kojeg od dva prethodno spomenuta načina da "
"nastavite. Puni opis kreiranja računa može biti pronađen u odjelu <link "
"linkend=\"details.accounts\">Računi</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:589
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now that one or more accounts exist in &kappname;, your account summary is "
"shown in the Home view. You can create transactions manually in the <link "
"linkend=\"details.ledgers\">Ledgers</link> view, or set up automatic "
"transactions through the <link linkend=\"details.schedules\">Schedules</"
"link> view."
msgstr ""
"Sada kada postoji više od jednog računa u &kappname;-u, kratak pregled vaših "
"računa je prikazan na početnoj stranici. Možete kreirati transakcije ručno u "
"<link linkend=\"details.ledgers\">Finansijske knjige</link>, ili uspostaviti "
"automatske transakcije kroz <link linkend=\"details.schedules\">Rasporedi</"
"link> prikaz."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:599
#, no-c-format
msgid "Schedules"
msgstr "Rasporedi"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:601
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes called a recurring transaction, a <link linkend=\"details.schedules"
"\">Schedule</link> is a transaction that occurs one or more times over a "
"certain period of time. A typical example is your pay check that you receive "
"every month or week. Rather than have to enter the transaction details each "
"time you get paid, you can instruct &kappname; to create a schedule that "
"will enter a transaction for you when you get paid."
msgstr ""
"Nekada se koristi termin ponavljajuća transakcija, <link linkend=\"details."
"schedules\">Raspored</link> je transakcije koja se odvija jednom ili više "
"puta tokom određenog vremenskog perioda. Tipičan primjer je vaša plata koju "
"primate svaki mjesec ili sedmicu. Umjesto da unosite transakciju svaki put "
"kada ste plaćeni, možete dati instrukciju &kappname;-u da kreira raspored po "
"kojem će unijeti transakciju kada budete isplaćeni."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:610
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To maintain <link linkend=\"details.schedules\">schedules</link> click on "
"the Schedules icon <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"schedule_view.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> "
"in the view selector."
msgstr ""
"Za održavanje <link linkend=\"details.schedules\">rasporedi</link> kliknite "
"na ikonu Rasporedi <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"schedule_view.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> "
"u izborniku prikaza."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:619
#, no-c-format
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Kategorije"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:621
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To maintain <link linkend=\"details.categories\">categories</link> click on "
"the <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"categories_view.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> "
"Categories icon in the view selector."
msgstr ""
"Za održavanje <link linkend=\"details.categories\">kategorije</link> "
"kliknite na <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"categories_view.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> ikonu "
"kategorije u izborniku prikaza."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:628
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A full description of this topic can be found in the <link linkend=\"details."
"categories\">Categories</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Puni opis ove teme može biti pronađen u dijelu <link linkend=\"details."
"categories\">Kategorije</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:635
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Oznake"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:637
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To maintain <link linkend=\"details.tags\">tags</link> click on the Tags "
"icon <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"mail-"
"tagged.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> in the view "
"selector."
msgstr ""
"Za održavanje <link linkend=\"details.tags\">oznaka</link> kliknite na ikonu "
"Oznake <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"mail-"
"tagged.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> u izborniku "
"prikaza."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:644
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A full description of this topic can be found in the <link linkend=\"details."
"tags\">Tags</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Puni opis ove teme može biti pronađen u dijelu <link linkend=\"details.tags"
"\">Oznake</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:651
#, no-c-format
msgid "Payees"
msgstr "Primatelji uplata"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:653
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To maintain your list of payees click on the Payees icon "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"payees_view.png"
"\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> in the view selector."
msgstr ""
"Za održavanje vaše liste primatelja uplata kliknite na ikonu Primatelji "
"uplata <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"payees_view.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> u "
"izborniku prikaza."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:660
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A full description of this topic can be found in the <link linkend=\"details."
"payees\">Payees</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Puni opis ove teme može biti pronađen u dijelu <link linkend=\"details.payees"
"\">Primatelji uplata</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quicken Interchange Format (QIF) Import"
msgstr "Quicken Interchange Format (QIF) Uvoz"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:669
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you currently use a financial manager application, &kappname; can import "
"an account's transactions as long as they are in the Quicken Interchange "
"Format (QIF). Most financial programs can export this format and the "
"different applications methods of exporting QIF is not discussed here for "
"brevity."
msgstr ""
"Ako trenutno koristite aplikaciju finansijskog upravitelja, &kappname; može "
"uvesti transakcije računa sve dok je njihov format Quicken Interchange "
"Format (QIF). Većina finansijskih programa može izvesti ovaj format, a "
"načini raznih aplikacija izvoza QIF-a nije opisan ovdje zbog sažetosti."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:676
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A full description of this topic can be found in the <link linkend=\"details."
"impexp.qifimp\">QIF Import</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Puni opis ove teme može biti pronađen u dijelu <link linkend=\"details."
"impexp.qifimp\">QIF Uvoz</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:683
#, no-c-format
msgid "Searching for transactions"
msgstr "Pretraga transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:685
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; provides a useful and powerful transaction search facility in the "
"form of the search dialog."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; nudi koristan i moćan način pretrage u obliku dijaloga pretrage."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:690
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The search dialog can be opened from the toolbar using the Find icon "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"transaction_find.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> or by "
"selecting <guimenuitem>Find Transaction</guimenuitem> from the "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Dijalog pretrage može biti otvoren iz alatne trake korištenjem ikone Traži "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"transaction_find.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> ili "
"odabirom <guimenuitem>Pronađi transakciju</guimenuitem> iz "
"<guimenu>Uređivanje</guimenu> menija."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:698
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A full description of this topic can be found in the <link linkend=\"details."
"search\">Search</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Puni opis ove teme može biti pronađen u dijelu <link linkend=\"details.search"
"\">Traži</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:706
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reconciliation"
msgstr "Usklađivanje"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:708
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At some point you will want to reconcile the transactions you have entered "
"with the transactions listed in a statement, be it a bank statement, credit "
"card statement, loan statement, or any other statement. Reconciliation "
"involves matching what you have entered with what the statement lists. If "
"any discrepancies are found then either you or the person who created the "
"statement have made a mistake."
msgstr ""
"U nekom trenutku ćete željeti uskladiti transakcije koje ste unijeli sa "
"transakcijama koje su izlistane u izvještaju, bilo bankovnom izvještaju, "
"bilo izvještaju kreditne kartice, kreditnom izvještaju ili bilo kojem "
"drugom. Usklađivanje uključuje povezivanje onoga što ste unijeli sa onim što "
"je izlistano u izvještajima. Ako se pojave određene nedosljednosti, onda ste "
"pogriješili ili vi, ili osoba koja je kreirala izvještaj."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:717
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To reconcile an account, first select the account, either from "
"<guiicon>Accounts</guiicon> view or from <guiicon>Ledgers</guiicon> view. "
"Then, either click on the <guiicon>Reconcile</guiicon> icon on the Toolbar, "
"or select <guimenuitem>Reconcile</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Account</"
"guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uskladili račun, prvo odaberite račun, iz pregleda <guiicon>Računi</"
"guiicon> ili iz pregleda <guiicon>Finansijske knjige</guiicon>. Onda, ili "
"kliknite na ikonu <guiicon>Uskladi</guiicon> u alatnoj traci, ili odaberite "
"<guimenuitem>Uskladi</guimenuitem> iz menija <guimenu>Račun</guimenu> ."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:725
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A full description of this topic can be found in the <link linkend=\"details."
"reconcile\">Reconciliation</link> section."
msgstr ""
"Puni opis ove teme može biti pronađen u dijelu <link linkend=\"details."
"reconcile\">Usklađivanje</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:732
#, no-c-format
msgid "Backing up"
msgstr "Rezervne kopije"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:734
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now that you have created some accounts and entered transactions it's a good "
"idea to perform a backup. Because the file used by &kappname; is a standard "
"Unix file you can just copy the file to another location to back it up or "
"use the dialog provided by &kappname;. Using the dialog is the preferred "
"method because if &kappname; ever starts using other file formats, such as "
"SQL, then it would be much harder to copy the file manually."
msgstr ""
"Sada kada ste kreirali neke račune i unijeli transakcije, dobra je ideja da "
"napravite rezervne kopije. Datoteka koju koristi &kappname; je standardna "
"UNIX datoteka, stoga je možete jednostavno kopirati na drugu lokaciju da "
"biste napravili rezervu ili koristiti dijalog koji pruža &kappname;. "
"Korištenje dijaloga je preferirana opcija jer ako &kappname; ikada počne "
"koristiti datoteke drugih formata kao što je SQL, onda bi bilo mnogo teže "
"kopirati datoteke ručno."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:743
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To backup your file through &kappname; Select <guimenuitem>Backup</"
"guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu and enter the folder "
"where you wish the file to be copied to. If the folder needs mounting first "
"and you have the sufficient privileges then check the tick box labeled "
"<guilabel>Mount this directory before backing up</guilabel> and click on "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste napravili rezervnu kopiju datoteke kroz &kappname; odaberite "
"<guimenuitem>Rezervna kopija</guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> "
"menija i unesite direktorij gdje želite kopirati datoteku. Ako direktorij "
"prvo treba kreirati i imata dovoljne privilegije onda zakačite okvir "
"naslovljen sa <guilabel>Kreiraj ovaj direktorij prije pravljenja rezervne "
"kopije</guilabel> i kliknite na <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:752
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The file will be copied to the folder specified with the current date "
"appended to the filename so it is easy to see the date the file was backed "
"up."
msgstr ""
"Datoteka će biti kopirana u direktorij određen trenutnim datuom priloženim "
"imenu datoteku tako da je jednostavno vidjeti datum kada je napravljena "
"rezervna kopija datoteke."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:759
#, no-c-format
msgid "Launching &kappname;"
msgstr "Pokretanje &kappname;-a"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:761
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most commonly, you will launch &kappname; from an icon or a start menu of "
"your window manager. In this case, the default behavior is that &kappname; "
"will open the last file you had open. However, in some circumstances, you "
"will want or need to launch &kappname; from the command line."
msgstr ""
"Najčešće ćete pokrenuti &kappname; pomoću ikone iz start menija ili vašeg "
"upravitelja prozorima. U ovom slučaju, unaprijed određeno ponašanje je da će "
"&kappname; otvoriti posljednju datoteku koju ste otvarali. Međutim, u nekim "
"okolnostima, željet ćete ili ćete morati pokrenuti &kappname; iz komandne "
"linije."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:768
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a complete description of all the available line options, see the man "
"page for &kappname;. However, there are two special cases which we describe "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Za potpun opis svih dostupnih opcija linije, pogledajte glavnu stranicu za "
"&kappname;. Međutim, postoje dva specijalna slučaja koje ćemo opisati ovdje."

#. Tag: command
#: firsttime.docbook:773
#, no-c-format
msgid "kmymoney -n"
msgstr "kmymoney -n"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:774
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The -n option tells &kappname; not to open the last file it had open. This "
"can be useful if the program crashes on startup."
msgstr ""
"-n opcija govori &kappname;-u da ne otvara datoteku koja je zadnja otvarana. "
"Ovo može biti korisno ako se program krahira prilikom startanja."

#. Tag: command
#: firsttime.docbook:780
#, no-c-format
msgid "kmymoney &lt;path to file&gt;"
msgstr "kmymoney &lt;path to file&gt;"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:781
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Giving &kappname; a filename on the command line tells it to open that file "
"instead of the last file it had open. You can use the name of any valid "
"&kappname; file, as described in the chapter on <link linkend=\"details."
"formats\">file formats</link>. In addition, this can be used to import a "
"<link linkend=\"details.impexp.gnucash\">GnuCash</link> file."
msgstr ""
"Unošenje imena datoteke u komandnoj liniju govori &kappname;-u da otvori tu "
"datoteku umjesto datoteke koja je zadnja otvarana. Možete koristiti ime bilo "
"koje validne &kappname; datoteke, što je opisano u poglavlju na <link "
"linkend=\"details.formats\">formati datoteka</link>. Dodatno, ovo može biti "
"korišteno za uvoz <link linkend=\"details.impexp.gnucash\">GnuCash</link> "
"datoteke."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:792
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to move &kappname; to a new computer"
msgstr "Kako prebaciti &kappname; na novi kompjuter"

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:795
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving your data"
msgstr "Prebacivanje vaših podataka"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:797
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you get a new computer, it's very easy to move your data. In fact, all "
"you have to do is to copy your &kappname; data file. The name of the file is "
"shown in the title bar when &kappname; is running, it usually ends in .kmy. "
"The first time you run the application on the new computer you will have to "
"tell it where you have put the data file, either by running from the command "
"line, or from the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu. You should even be able to move between "
"&Windows;, &MacOS;, and &Linux; systems."
msgstr ""
"Ako kupite novi kompjuter, veoma je lako prebaciti sve podatke. Ustvari, sve "
"što trebate uraditi je kopirati vašu &kappname; datoteku podataka. Ime ove "
"datoteke je prikazano u naslovnom okviru kada je &kappname; pokrenut, obično "
"završava na .kmy. Kada prvi put pokrenete aplikaciju na novom kompjuteru "
"moraćete joj reći gdje ste spremili datoteku podataka, tako što je pokrenete "
"iz komandne linije, ili iz <menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Otvori...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menija. Trebalo bi "
"biti moguće prebacivanje sa  &Windows;, &MacOS;, i &Linux; sistema."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:808
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have encrypted your data file, be sure the appropriate software and "
"keys have also been set up on the new computer."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste šifrirali vašu datoteku podataka, osigurajte se da su uspostavljeni "
"ključevi i odgovarajuči softver na novom računaru."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:813
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your data is in an SQL database, refer to documentation for your database "
"software for guidance on migrating your data."
msgstr ""
"Ako su vaši podaci SQL baza podataka, pogledajte dokumentaciju za softver "
"vaše baze podataka kako biste dobili upute za prebacivanje vaših podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:818
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that this assumes you have installed the same version of &kappname; on "
"the new computer as you were running on the old computer. Installing a newer "
"version should also be safe, but you need to be aware of any issues related "
"to that upgrade. Any such issues should be noted in the release notes for "
"the new version."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da ovo podrazumijeva da ste instalirali istu verziju "
"&kappname;-a na novom računaru koju ste koristili na starom. Instaliranje "
"novije verzije bi također trebalo biti sigurno, ali trebate biti svjesni "
"problema koji mogu nastati nadogradnjom. Bilo kakvi problemi te vrste bi "
"trebali biti zabilježeni u bilješkama za novu verziju."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:827
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving your settings"
msgstr "Prebacivanje vaših postavki"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:829
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you only move your data file to the new machine, as described in the "
"previous section, &kappname; will work correctly, but you will have lost any "
"settings you changed from the default on your old machine. To maintain these "
"settings, you also need to copy your configuration file. This file is called "
"<quote>kmymoneyrc</quote>. This file will be in a directory with other &kde; "
"application configuration files. On a &Linux; system, this will be in <quote>"
"$KDEHOME/share/config</quote> where <quote>$KDEHOME</quote> is usually "
"<quote>.kde4</quote> within your home directory."
msgstr ""
"Ako pomjerite samo podatke na novi računar, kao što je opisano u prethodnom "
"dijelu, &kappname; će raditi ispravno, ali ćete izgubiti bilo kakve promjene "
"postavki u odnosu na unaprijed definisane. Da biste sačuvai te postavke, "
"također trebate kopirati datoteku konfiguracija. Ova datoteka se zove "
"<quote>kmymoneyrc</quote>. Ova datoteka će se nalaziti u direktoriju sa "
"ostalim &kde; aplikacijskim konfiguracionim datotekama. Na &Linux; sistemu, "
"nalazit će se u <quote>$KDEHOME/share/config</quote> gdje se <quote>"
"$KDEHOME</quote> obično nalazi <quote>.kde4</quote> u vašem početnom "
"direktoriju."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:841
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving plugin settings"
msgstr "Prebacivanje postavki dodataka"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:843
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have run any &kappname; plugins, such as the csv importer or "
"exporter, it may also have created a configuration file in that same "
"directory, such as csvimporterrc or csvexporterrc. These should also be "
"copied to the new computer."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste pokrenuli bilo kakve &kappname; dodatke kao što je csv uvoznik ili "
"izvoznik, to je također možda kreiralo konfiguracionu datoteku, kao što su "
"csvimporterrc ili csvexporterrc. Ove datoteke bi također trebale biti "
"kopirane na vaš novi računar."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:850
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As with the main data file, this assumes the same version of the plugin on "
"both computers. Upgrades are generally safe, but if the functionality of the "
"plugin has changed greatly, it is advisable to carefully test using the old "
"configuration file, to be sure the plugin behaves as you expect."
msgstr ""
"Kao što je slučaj i sa glavnom datotekom podataka, ovo podrazumijeva istu "
"verziju dodatka na oba računara. Nadogradnje su uglavnom sigurne, ali "
"ukoliko se funkcionalnost dodatka značajno promijenila, savjetuje se "
"pažljivo testiranje korištenjem stare konfiguracione datoteke, da se osigura "
"da se dodatak ponaša onako kako očekujete."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:858
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These instructions are solely for moving your &kappname; data and settings. "
"However, there may be important items which are stored by &kde; and not by "
"&kappname;, such as any passwords stored in kwallet. Moving other parts of "
"your &kde; setup is beyond the scope of this manual, although many of the "
"relevant files are also stored under <quote>$KDEHOME</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Ove upute su samo za prebacivanje vaših &kappname; podataka i postavki. "
"Međutim, moguće je da postoje važne stavke koje su pohranjene od strane "
"&kde;-a, ne od strane &kappname;-a, kao što su lozinke pohranjene u kwallet-"
"u. Prebacivanje ostalih dijelova vaših &kde; postavki izlazi izvan opsega "
"ovog priručnika, iako su mnoge releventne datoteke također pohranjene pod "
"<quote>$KDEHOME</quote>."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:871
#, no-c-format
msgid "Contacting the Developers / Reporting Bugs"
msgstr "Kontaktiranje razvojnih inženjera / Prijavljivanje grešaka"

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:874
#, no-c-format
msgid "Contacting the developers"
msgstr "Kontaktiranje razvojnih inženjera"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:876
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For general questions or comments about &kappname;, there is a users' "
"mailing list &userlist;. In addition, you can contact the developers through "
"their mailing list &devlist;."
msgstr ""
"Za opća pitanje ili komentare o &kappname;-u, postoji mailing lista "
"korisnika &userlist;. Također, možete kontaktirati razvojne inženjere putem "
"njihovih mailing listi &devlist;."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:882
#, no-c-format
msgid "We're happy to hear about your experiences using &kappname;."
msgstr "Drago nam je kad čujemo o vašim iskustvima u korištenju &kapname;-a."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:888
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reporting bugs"
msgstr "Prijava grešaka"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:890
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To report a bug please use the interface provided by &kappname; by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Report Bug</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> and filling in the required information. However, in case you "
"have any difficulties with that method, you can report a bug (or file a wish-"
"list or enhancement request) directly at the <ulink url=\"http://bugs.kde.org"
"\">&kde; bug reporting web page</ulink>. Reports should be filed against the "
"product <quote>kmymoney4</quote>. <quote>kmymoney2</quote> was specifically "
"for bugs in the 1.0.x versions of the application, and as those versions are "
"no longer supported, it is closed for further bug reporting."
msgstr ""
"Da biste prijavili grešku molimo koristite sučelje koje &kappname; pruža, "
"odabirom <menuchoice><guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu><guimenuitem>Prijavi grešku</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> i popunjavanjem neophodnih informacija. Međutim, u "
"slučaju da imate bilo kakvih poteškoća sa ovim načinom, možete prijaviti "
"grešku (ili poslati listu želja ili zahtjev za poboljšanje) na <ulink url="
"\"http://bugs.kde.org\">stranica prijavljivanja &kde; grešaka</ulink>. "
"Izvještaji bi trebali biti slani za proizvod <quote>kmymoney4</quote>. "
"<quote>kmymoney2</quote> je samo za greške u 1.0.x verzijama aplikacije, a "
"kako te verzije nisu više podržane, više nije otvoreno za prijavu grešaka."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:903
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In any case, before reporting a bug, please read through the guidelines "
"below. Following them will make it more likely that the developers will be "
"able to quickly identify the problem without having to ask you for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"U svakom slučaju, prije prijave greške, molimo pročitajte upute ispod. "
"Praćenje njih će olakšati razvojnim inženjerima da brzo identifikuju problem "
"bez potrebe da pitaju vas za više informacija."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:910
#, no-c-format
msgid "Writing High Quality Bug Reports"
msgstr "Pisanje visoko kvalitetnih prijava grešaka"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:912
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We encourage users to take extra time to write high-quality bug reports when "
"submitting them. This reduces wasted effort on all sides, as the reporter "
"and the developer who will fix it trade emails until this information is "
"really in place."
msgstr ""
"Mi ohrabrujemo korisnike da potroše dodatnu količinu vremena za pisanje "
"visoko-kvalitetnih prijava grešaka. Ovo smanjuje utrošeni napor na svim "
"stranama, jer izvještač i razvojni inženjer koji će popravljati grešku "
"razmjenjuju email-ove sve dok se ova informacija ne nađe na pravom mjestu."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:919
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Eli Goldberg wrote the canonical Bug-Writing Guideline, available at <ulink "
"url=\"http://issues.apache.org/bugwritinghelp.html\">http://issues.apache."
"org/bugwritinghelp.html</ulink>. Generally, you'll be well-served by "
"following these guidelines:"
msgstr ""
"Eli Goldberg je napisao kanonski oblik Pisanja grešaka, dostupan na <ulink "
"url=\"http://issues.apache.org/bugwritinghelp.html\">http://issues.apache."
"org/bugwritinghelp.html</ulink>. Generalno, izuzetno je koisno pratiti ove "
"upute."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:925
#, no-c-format
msgid "Include your system information"
msgstr "Uključi sistemske informacije"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:926
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Report Bug</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu choice will fill this in automatically, but "
"if you would prefer not to use this interface, there are several items you "
"need to include in the report. We will need to know what operating system "
"you are using (&Linux;, &MacOS;, or &Windows;), the version of &kde; and the "
"version of &kappname; you're running, and either the version of &MacOS; or "
"&Windows; or the name and version of your &Linux; distribution and the "
"version of your kernel."
msgstr ""
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu><guimenuitem>Prijavi grešku</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> će ovo popuniti automatski, ali ako radije ne "
"biste koristili ovo sučelje, postoji više stavki koje trebate uključiti u "
"izvještaj. Trebat ćemo znati koji operativni sistem koristite (&Linux;, "
"&MacOS;, or &Windows;), verziju &kde;-a i verziju &kappname;-a koju "
"koristite, te ili verziju &MacOS; ili &Windows; ili ime i verziju vaše "
"&Linux; distribucije i verziju kernel-a."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:938
#, no-c-format
msgid "Include a backtrace for crashes"
msgstr "Uključi povratni trag za krahiranja"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:939
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The backtrace is often the single most useful piece of information in "
"solving crashes."
msgstr ""
"Povratni trag je najčešće najkorisnija informacija za rješavanje krahova."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:945
#, no-c-format
msgid "Try to reproduce it"
msgstr "Pokušajte ih reproducirati"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:946
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let us know if you were able to do so. It's useful to know whether the bug "
"only happened once and you couldn't get it to happen again or happens every "
"time or happens sometimes but not others."
msgstr ""
"Javite nam ako ste uspjeli to uraditi. Korisno je znati da li se grešla "
"desila samo jednom i niste je uspjeli ponoviti ili se nekad dešava, a nekad "
"ne."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:953
#, no-c-format
msgid "Include specific steps"
msgstr "Uključite specifične korake"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:954
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a bad bug report: <quote>I entered a transaction, and &kappname; "
"crashed.</quote> A much better bug report is: <quote>Using the transaction "
"form, I entered a new transaction in my Credit Card account. I selected the "
"Transfer tab, entered in an amount, then changed to the Deposit tab, and "
"back to the Transfer tab. When I returned to the Transfer tab, &kappname; "
"crashed. This bug is fully reproducible for me.</quote>"
msgstr ""
"Ovo je loš izvještaj o grešci: <quote>Unio sam transakciju, i &kappname; se "
"krahirao.</quote> Mnogo bolji izvještaj o grešci je <quote>Korištenjem forme "
"za transakciju, unio sam novu transakciju u račun za kreditnu karticu. "
"Odabrao sam karticu Prebaci, unio iznos, onda sam se prebacio na karticu "
"Depozit , i vratio se na karticu Prebaci. Kada sam se vratio na karticu "
"Prebaci, &kappname; se krahirao. Ova greška mi se stalno dešava.</quote>"

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:964
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tell us what you expected to happen"
msgstr "Recite nam šta ste očekivali da se desi"

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:965
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In some cases, this is obvious, but in more subtle bugs, sometimes you'll "
"see a bug report where it is not obvious what the reporter expected to "
"happen. Always tell us what you think should have happened."
msgstr ""
"U nekim situacijama, ovo je očigledno, ali kod suptilnijih grešaka, vidjet "
"ćete izvještaj u kojem nije jasno šta je podnosilac izvještaja očekivao da "
"se desi. Uvijek nam recite šta vi mislite, šta se trebalo dogoditi."

#. Tag: title
#: firsttime.docbook:972
#, no-c-format
msgid "Consider running with debugging enabled"
msgstr "Pokušajte pokrenuti sa debugging-om uključenim."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:973
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By compiling a version configured with --enable-debug=full you can ensure "
"that the best possible backtraces are generated. If you encounter a crash, "
"run &kappname; again from within gdb, and reproduce the crash. When it "
"crashes, type <quote>bt</quote> to generate a backtrace."
msgstr ""
"Kompajliranjem verzije konfigurasane sa --enable-debug=full možete se "
"osigurati da su generisani najbolji povratni tragovi. Ako naletite na krah, "
"pokrenite &kappname; ponovo iz gdb-a, i reproducirajte krah. Kada se "
"krahira, unesite <quote>bt</quote> za generisanje povratnog traga."

#. Tag: para
#: firsttime.docbook:981
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Running this way is a bit more difficult, so we don't expect all users to do "
"this. However, if you're interested in helping &kappname; become as stable "
"as possible, this is the best way to do it short of finding the bug in the "
"code and sending in a patch."
msgstr ""
"Pokretanje na ovaj način je malo teže, tako da ne očekujemo od svih "
"korisnika da urade ovo. Međutim, ako ste zainteresovani da pomognete "
"&kappname;-u da postanje što je moguće stabilniji, ovo je najbolji način da "
"uradite ovo. Jedini bolji način od ovog je da nađete grešku u kodu i "
"pošaljete ispravak."

